"and :ref:`WebRTCDataChannel <class_WebRTCDataChannel>`, plus the multiplayer "
"API implementation :ref:`WebRTCMultiplayerPeer "
"<class_WebRTCMultiplayerPeer>`. See section on :ref:`high-level multiplayer "
